  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The Gu Yue academy elder places upper stage as the third of four small realms inside each of the nine ranks, after initial stage and middle stage, and before peak stage.",
      "chapters": [
        7
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_yue_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Moving from middle stage to upper stage is a small realm. Breaking from rank one peak stage into rank two initial stage is a large realm, and the two difficulties are not the same.",
      "chapters": [
        90
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nurturing the aperture with primeval essence is how a Gu Master climbs the small realms. Upper stage walls are stone barriers, also called a stone membrane,",
      "chapters": [
        33
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "aperture-walls",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "light condensed into a solid state, thicker and more stable than the middle stage water membrane. A rank one upper stage aperture shows that stone membrane clearly.",
      "chapters": [
        230
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "aperture-walls",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Within a rank, higher stage darkens the essence and makes it more durable in use. Green copper primeval essence at rank one upper stage is dark green. A Liquor worm can refine middle stage essence up into that upper stage product, so battle strength can sit above the Gu Master’s true cultivation stage when the worm is feeding the sea.",
      "chapters": [
        80
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "primeval-essence-at-this-stage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_liquor_worm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Red steel primeval essence, at rank two upper stage, is crimson.",
      "chapters": [
        145
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-two-colour",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_red_steel_primeval_essence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "White silver essence at rank three upper stage is bright silver, shining silver in colour.",
      "chapters": [
        312
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-three-colour",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_white_silver_primeval_essence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Within rank four, upper stage yellow gold essence is called essence gold primeval essence.",
      "chapters": [
        358
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-four-colour",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Purple crystal essence at rank five upper stage is deep purple.",
      "chapters": [
        379
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-five-colour",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_purple_crystal_primeval_essence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Initial Stage, Middle Stage, and Peak Stage complete the set. The full rank ladder is on Ranks and Realms. Essence by rank is on Primeval Essence.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
